Text:
@BigAlphaID Artinya kalau naruh deposito di bank, bunganya belum akan naik &lt;=3.5%
Sementara kalau pinjam uang di bank juga seharusnya gak naik =&gt;3.5% (3.5%+spread)

Inflasi (kenaikan harga barang secara umum) melebihi suku bunga acuan (naruh deposito di bank RUGI,tergerus inflasi)

translated_Text:
@Bigalphaid means that if you put a deposit in the bank, the interest will not rise <= 3.5%
Meanwhile, if you borrow money at the bank, it should not rise => 3.5% (3.5%+spread)

Inflation (increase in the price of goods in general) exceeds the benchmark interest rate (put a deposit in a loss bank, eroded inflation)

